  "albumInformation": "<p>Alive (Doing It Right) is Mise’s first single off of Plastic Love (out this November). It features Mise in a state of discovery in a new land of opportunity, experimentation, and confusion. Why be caught up in doing it right when doing it wrong makes you feel so alive? // Produced and recorded at Hive Studios in Hamilton, ON. Vocals and lyrics by Mise.</p>\n<p>contact email: <a href=\"mailto:misenation@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\">misenation@gmail.com</a></p>",
